/**
 * ImmoRadar demo seed.
 *
 * Builds a fully demonstrable environment WITHOUT touching any real website:
 * - 5 agencies, 15 users, ~25 territories
 * - ~500 CRM contacts (with interactions and property relationships)
 * - ~150 properties / ~250 listings / ~750 snapshots, generated by running
 *   backdated listing timelines through the REAL ingestion pipeline, so
 *   snapshots, events (price drops, stale, removed, relisted, FSBO) and
 *   property matching are all authentic engine output.
 * - Scenarios A-E from the product brief.
 * - Opportunities, LeadRevive scans, alerts and workflow history.
 *
 * Idempotent by wiping first. Run: npm run db:seed
 */

